If seriously, this game/movie doesn't have good plot, it's flat and straight forward. Also, full of pathos, like the bloody thriller from Hollywood, it is everywhere, in every cutscene and is frustrating sometimes.
Thanks god this game is voice acted, animated and looks as AAA+ game should look. What I really enjoyed was that I wasn't fooled by crytek, recieved what bought - smooth looking 10 hour pure adrenaline with average written script and 50/50 of game/long movie.
Do I reccomend it? Yes, I do and this is why:
+PROS+
1) Game is really cheap on steam right now, even at full price($12.49);
2) It has somewhat long and various gameplay(10-12 hours with cutscenes!);
3) Enviorment mostly are not repetitive(Mission 3 - Trial by Fire and Mission 5 - Edge of the World were f*cking masterpieces);
4) Game has funny easter eggs, look for them in community guides;
5) Disable HUD and make your own wallpapers, like in Mad Max, any frame is looking awesome;
6) Co-op is super fun with friend but average with online player, it's amusing only for first 4-5 hours, after it gets repetitive, but there are 50 maps and that's really cool, maybe you won't be bored;
7) Executions are done really cool, little repetitive, but when you realise you killed 1000 enemy, some executions will be repeated of course.
-CONS-
1) Singleplayer plot could be more dramatic, avenging family death was in every second game and killing people, who you met just once or twise bofore is stupid;
2) Controls on keyboard in singleplayer and camera movement in some co-op missions is broken, I never realised that it was this hard to press E to pick up spears during battle or why not look in your characters♥♥♥♥♥while he's making execution;
3) Speaking of executions, this game is hard/easy/repetitive in battle, when somewhat different enemy types are surrounding you and you need to be careful and use same tactics all the time(choose single enemy, beat enemy, then execution), execution is done so, that you can't be wrong, difference is the XP you get after;
4) Boss fights, I hoped there will be good boss fights, but was dissapointed. Just hit them once or twise before they will get up, evade their repetitive attacks and hit let's say 50-500 times. There was only 4 boss fights, twice with one persone and last boss fight isn't really a boss fight, I'm not including that, but it was done differently at least.
My verdict and final score is: 7.5/10

